      "description": "The Arbor Student App gives you a convenient and intuitive way to access your day-to-day school information, understand your progress, and receive in-app messages from your school.\n\nThe Arbor Student App is only for students at schools using Arbor MIS. If you're not sure whether this applies to you, we recommend contacting your school office.\n\nUse the Arbor Student App to:\n- Receive messages from your school: Whether it's an exam room change, a non-uniform day, or a PE kit - office staff and teachers can easily and quickly alert you to important announcements.\n\n- Log in in seconds: With biometric login, you can get to the information you need, on the device you use most. The app is also optimised to work on any device, including desktop and tablets.\n\n- Check your calendar: See your information just as it appears in Arbor. You can be confident you're seeing the most up-to-date info - no need for timetable print outs that go out of date.\n\n- Ask Arbor your questions: The Student App includes Ask Arbor, our AI powered assistant that helps you find out information about your school life, without relying on office staff.\n\n- Encourage students to be accountable: Students can see the information they need to be in control of their own progress, like their behaviour points, assignments, and attendance. When students take ownership of their learning, they’re more likely to be engaged in school life - resulting in better outcomes.",
